{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/47c7d124bfad1c954f5f18154aebff94.poster.avif?t=1762503853\" width=614 height=36 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/47c7d124bfad1c954f5f18154aebff94.webm?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/47c7d124bfad1c954f5f18154aebff94.mp4?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I AM ABRAHAM VAN HELSING - PHYSICIAN, SCHOLAR, AND RELUCTANT HUNTER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From my study in Amsterdam, I was summoned east by a letter from my old friend Jonathan. His words spoke of disappearances, of shallow graves filled with the nameless, and of a creature that walks between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My path was set for a remote village in the Carpathian Mountains - yet before I could reach it, the night rose against me. My stagecoach was overturned, my companions slaughtered, and I awoke alone in the Knight's lodge, the air thick with the smell of blood and damp earth. The trail leads into the Hoia Baciu Forest - a place whispered of in superstition, where the living and the dead walk side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/32e330f04dc8ab89f0126b61e090a1b9.poster.avif?t=1762503853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/32e330f04dc8ab89f0126b61e090a1b9.webm?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/32e330f04dc8ab89f0126b61e090a1b9.mp4?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GOTHIC SURVIVAL HORROR EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Redemption of the Damned</i> blends tense, deliberate combat with methodical investigation, set across hand-crafted locations. From the haunted forest to the cursed village, from abandoned chapels to nightmarish fortresses reached only by occult gates, each step draws me closer to Dracula\u2019s generals - and the truths they guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am no superhuman hero. Ammunition is scarce, wounds slow the body, and the mind can falter in the face of unspeakable horrors. In this land, every decision carries weight\u2026 and the darkness is always watching.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/34d38759decb63848e90db55b563a1f7.poster.avif?t=1762503853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/34d38759decb63848e90db55b563a1f7.webm?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/34d38759decb63848e90db55b563a1f7.mp4?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate the Unnatural</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Track Dracula\u2019s generals by examining corpses, analysing wounds, and piecing together the clues others would overlook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft to Endure and Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Salvage and forge weapons, ammunition, and tools from the remnants of a dying land - from hand-built pistols and silver-shot cartridges to holy relics and improvised stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/e248a7cb869b249140d7e9936631be97.poster.avif?t=1762503853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/e248a7cb869b249140d7e9936631be97.webm?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/e248a7cb869b249140d7e9936631be97.mp4?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel Clues and Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The environment itself is a labyrinth of secrets. Study symbols, decode writings, and connect fragments of knowledge to reveal the path ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/ee3d3516547923efddd4ef194c1b3da0.poster.avif?t=1762503853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/ee3d3516547923efddd4ef194c1b3da0.webm?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/ee3d3516547923efddd4ef194c1b3da0.mp4?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight with Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Carefully study your enemy, prepare thoroughly and choose the appropriate way to kill. Melee combat, traditional and unique firearms, and, of course, specific ways of killing are available to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot counts. Learn each creature\u2019s behaviour and weaknesses - be it silver, stake, flame, or relic - and strike with precision. But be careful as enemies learn and adapt to your combat style also!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/ca89f00a720c6219da8a1356b8b30f29.poster.avif?t=1762503853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/ca89f00a720c6219da8a1356b8b30f29.webm?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/ca89f00a720c6219da8a1356b8b30f29.mp4?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL THE BEAST - IF YOU DARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dracula\u2019s generals are not mere monsters, but ancient minds honed by centuries of cruelty. To face them unprepared is to court death; to defeat them is to cut deeper into the Count\u2019s dark dominion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Chronicle of Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter characters and creatures steeped in the lore of <i>Dracula</i> and Slavic superstition, each encounter revealing another shadow in the grand design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/a8898ed6ca9175e93744caa627fce6cf.poster.avif?t=1762503853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620420/extras/a8898ed6ca9175e93744caa627fce6cf.webm?t=1762503853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\